$DATUM Intermediate K7.1 In a sealed tube a solution of
(R)-1-[1-(3-bromo-phenyl)-1H-pyrazol-4-yl]-3-cyanato-2,2-difluoro-1-methylpropylamine
(3.0 g, 8.08 mmol) and ammonium hydroxide (25% in water, 7 ml) in
methanol (10 ml) was heated to 60°C for 16 hours. For the workup, the
solution was evaporated at reduced pressure. The crude material thus
obtained was purified by column chromatography on silica gel using a
95:5-mixture of dichloromethane and methanol as the eluent.
(R)-4-[1-(3-bromo-phenyl)-1H-pyrazol-4-yl]-5,5-difluoro-4-methyl-5,6-dihydro-4H-[1,3]oxazin-2-ylamine
(2.0 g, 54% yield) as a white solid. MS (ISP): m/z = 371.2 [M+H]+.
