(R)-3-amino-3-[1-(3-bromo-phenyl)-1H-pyrazol-4-yl]-2,2-difluoro-butan-1-ol
(5.1 g, 14.73 mmol) and sodium acetate (3.62 g, 44.2 mmol) in ethanol (90
ml) was warmed to 40°C. Cyanogen bromide (1.71 g, 16.21 mmol) was added
and the mixture allowed to stir at 40°C for 16 hours. Removal of the
solvent at reduced pressure followed by purification of the resultant
crude material by column chromatography on silica gel using a 3:2-mixture
of hexane and ethyl acetate as the eluent. The
(R)-1-[1-(3-bromo-phenyl)-1H-pyrazol-4-yl]-3-cyanato-2,2-difluoro-1-methyl-propylamine
(3.2 g, 58% yield) as a colorless sticky solid. MS (ISP): m/z = 369.2
[M+H]+.
