$DATUM 7732-18-5
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Iodoaniline A preparation: NIS (2.52 g, 11.2 mmol) was added at 0°C to a
solution of the aniline (3.6 g, 9.31 mmol, Scheme 10) in DMF (40 mL).
After 60 minutes at 0°C and 60 min at RT, the reaction was quenched with
saturated aq. NaHCO3 (aq), extracted with EtOAc (3 x), and the combined
organic layers dried over Na2SO4. After removal of the volatiles under
reduced pressure, the residue was subjected to silica gel chromatography
(gradient elution 100:0 to 70:30 hexanes:EtOAc) to give the iodoaniline
(3.2 g, 67%).
