$DATUM Step c):
N-(4-Ethynylphenyl)-N'-[4-(2-imino-1,3-oxazolidin-3-yl)phenyl]pyrazine-2,3-dicarboxamide
methanesulfonate. A solution of 50 mg (0.09 mmol) of
N-{4-[(2-{[tert-butyl(dimethyl)silyl]oxy}ethyl)(cyano)amino]phenyl}-N'-(4-ethynylphenyl)pyrazine-2,3-dicarboxamide
in 10 ml of acetonitrile is mixed with 13 μl (0.19 mmol) of
methanesulfonic acid at Rt, and the mixture is stirred overnight at RT.
The precipitate formed is filtered off, washed with acetonitrile and
dried in vacuum. Yield: 18 mg (37% of theory). LC-MS (Method 3): Rt =
1.47 min; MS (ESlpos): m/z = 427 [M+H]+ (free base); 1H-NMR (300 MHz,
DMSO-d6): δ = 11.02 (s, 1H), 10.97 (s, 1H), 9.57 (s, 1H), 8.98 (s, 2H),
8.81 (s, 1H), 7.92 (d, 2H), 7.78 (d, 2H), 7.55-7.44 (m, 4H), 4.85 (t,
2H), 4.23 (t, 2H), 4.15 (s, 1H).2.29 (s.3H).
